  "body": "Step into effortless coastal luxury with this beautifully crafted, brand-new residence, thoughtfully designed to maximise natural sunlight, privacy and everyday comfort. Spread across two levels, this stylish home offers a perfect balance of space, functionality and contemporary living.\r\n\r\nImmaculately presented and ready to move in, all that’s left to do is bring your furniture and enjoy the exceptional lifestyle on offer.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living and dining areas, complemented by a stylish contemporary kitchen and seamless access to a private outdoor entertaining area.\r\n• Three generous double bedrooms, two modern bathrooms and an additional guest WC.\r\nInternal-access single garage plus extra off-street parking.\r\n• Brand-new construction with contemporary finishes and a practical two-level layout.\r\n\r\nAvailable Properties\r\n• 41B – 204m² land | 124m² floor area\r\n• 41C – 148m² land | 124m² floor area\r\n• 41D – 148m² land | 124m² floor area\r\n• 41E – 149m² land | 120m² floor area\r\n\r\nA Coveted Coastal Lifestyle\r\nEnjoy the best of Mairangi Bay living, just moments from the vibrant village, where boutique cafés, popular restaurants and local shops create a welcoming community atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe nearby beach offers the perfect setting for morning swims, paddleboarding and relaxing seaside walks, while local tennis courts, parks and golf courses provide plenty of opportunities to enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nTriple School Zone\r\nFamilies will appreciate zoning for Westlake Boys’ High School, Westlake Girls’ High School and Rangitoto College, along with Mairangi Bay Primary School, Campbells Bay Primary School and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n\r\nYour Coastal Lifestyle Starts Here\r\nWhether you’re a growing family, a professional couple or a buyer seeking a quality brand-new home in a sought-after North Shore location, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nSecure your place in one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
